@startuml 03-deployment-cicd
' Source of truth for docs/images/03-deployment-cicd.svg — regenerated by
' .github/workflows/render-diagrams.yml. Edit this file, never the SVG.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam DefaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F4F7FB
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #33475B
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FBEFD5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #A9822C
skinparam ArrowColor #33475B
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #FBFBFB
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #9AA5B1

|Developer|
start
:Opens / updates a Pull Request\n(direct push to master is forbidden —\neverything goes through a PR);

|GitHub Actions — checks (on every PR)|
fork
  :backend-web-checks.yml\nPostgres service → prisma migrate →\ntypecheck → vitest → Stryker\n(backend and frontend) → next build;
fork again
  :visual-tests.yml\nPlaywright (Chromium/Desktop/\nTablet/Mobile) → compares against\nsnapshots → report to gh-pages\n+ PR comment;
fork again
  if (did docs/diagrams/*.puml change?) then (yes)
    :render-diagrams.yml\nself-contained plantuml/plantuml\nCLI container (no network, no\ncall to the project's own private\nPlantUML server) →\nrenders .puml → .svg;
    :commits docs/images/*.svg\nback to the PR branch\n(same-repo PRs only,\nnever forks);
  else (no)
    :step is skipped;
  endif
end fork

|Developer|
if (need to accept new\nvisual snapshots?) then (yes, /update-snapshots comment)
  :accept-visual-baselines.yml\nguard → update-snapshots →\ncommits PNGs to the PR branch;
else (no)
endif

:Review and merge the PR into master\n(the merge itself is a push event to master);

|GitHub Actions — deploy|
:deploy-frontend.yaml / build\nnpm ci → next build →\nrelease.tar.gz → artifact;

if (push to master?) then (yes)
  :deploy-dev\n(workflow_call → deploy-target.yml)\nbase: yuriisoft-frontend-dev;
else (no — wait for a tag)
endif

if (v* tag created?) then (yes)
  :github-release\nattaches release.tar.gz\nto a GitHub Release;
  :deploy-prod\n(workflow_call → deploy-target.yml)\nbase: yuriisoft-frontend;
else (no)
endif

|deploy-target.yml (reusable)|
:scp-action — copies release.tar.gz\n+ deploy-frontend.sh to VPS /tmp;
:ssh-action — runs\ndeploy-frontend.sh <tag> on the VPS;

|VPS|
:releases/<timestamp>_<tag>/\nunpacks the archive;
:sudo deploy-frontend-finish.sh —\nshared/.env → backend/.env,\nprisma migrate deploy (as nextapp);
:current → symlink\nswitched to the new release (after a\nsuccessful migration);
:systemctl restart\nyuriisoft-frontend[-dev]\n+ is-active check;
:nginx (TLS, rate-limit) keeps\nproxying to 127.0.0.1:3000|3001;
stop

@enduml
